  "Controls how achievements are handled while using one of the Semi-Roguelike permadeath modes.  If enabled (the default), achievements will be registered as Roguelike-mode achievements if you gain them before you receive your first extra life, and as Adventure-mode achievements if you gain them after receiving your first extra life; if disabled, all achievements will be registered as Adventure-mode achievements.": "",
