  "Inventory Keys": "",
  "An interface to configure the shortcut keys used in the use-item dialog.  The configuration dialog lists all the item actions that the game knows about or has seen in use, and allows you to set or clear shortcut keys for each.\n      \n#YELLOW##{italic}#[DISCLAIMER:  This is an experimental interface.  Some keys may not work as shortcut keys.]#{normal}##LAST#": "",
  "#GOLD##{bold}#Sort gems by tier#WHITE##{normal}#": "",
  "Inventory Sort Order": "",
  "If enabled, gems of the same tier will be grouped together in your inventory and sorted by color; if disabled, they will be grouped by color and sorted by tier.": "",
  "If enabled, all items in your inventory will be sorted by the time they were picked up from the floor (or local equivalent).  Items picked up at the same time will be sorted in the usual order.  Supported values are 'Newest First', 'Oldest First' or 'Disabled'.\n\n#YELLOW#[#{bold}#NOTE:#{normal}#  Items that you started the game with, items purchased from stores, and items that are placed directly into your inventory (such as quest rewards) will be treated as least recently picked up.  You can avert this by dropping and picking up the relevant items to assign it a specific pickup time.  We Apologize for the Inconvenience.(TM)]#LAST#": "",
