  "Sort by pickup time": "",
  "Choose setting:": "",
  "If enabled, weapons in the same \"category\" (offhand-wieldable, other one-handed, staffs, other two-handed, longbows, slings) will be sorted in increasing order by damage done.  If you have unarmed combat talents or shield combat talents, or have the corresponding \"show combat properties\" game options enabled, gloves and shields, respectively, will also be sorted by increasing damage.\n\n#YELLOW#(#{bold}#NOTE:#{normal}#  If you change your stats or talents or make other changes that change your weapon damage, your inventory will not be automatically re-sorted to reflect the changes.  You can re-sort manually by dropping something and picking it back up, or by disabling and re-enabling this option.)#LAST#": "",
