  "Controls how talent trees are sorted in the levelup dialog and the point planner dialog.  Supported values are:\n      \n· '#LIGHT_BLUE#None#LAST#':  The default; known and unlearnt trees are sorted in internal default order.\n· '#LIGHT_BLUE#Unlearnt#LAST#':  Known trees are sorted in internal default order; unlearnt trees are sorted alphabetically by name.\n· '#LIGHT_BLUE#All#LAST#':  Both known and unlearnt trees are sorted alphabetically by name.": "",
